      "content": "it's just metaphors, isn't it? doors, hallways... it's all just noise. if you look at it objectively, life is just a series of random events with no inherent meaning. if nothing matters, then the value of existing vs not existing is basically zero. it's all just a neutral equation. why is it so hard to just accept that?",
